# ---- the chorus ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

ly.chorus (formula keep people=5)
  and {skyone} over us, and nothing to do but stay.
  oh {city}, {city}, you never let me go.
  so dance, dance, before the lights go out.
  {endear}, {endear}, come home before {season.next}.
  and {river} runs on, and we run on with it.
  {colour.holy} like the doors of {city}, {colour.holy} like the morning.
  hold on, hold on, the {msg.transit}'s coming.
  and the {bird} know the way, and so do I.
  {exclaim}, {exclaim}, what a night it was.
  sing it for {festival}, sing it for me.
  and all the lamps of {city} are lit for you.
  the {herd} are home, and so are you, la, la.
  and the {craft} works hum, and the night goes on.
  {food} on the table and you at the door.
  under {roofs}, under {roofs}, we'll be all right.
  oh {city}, my {city}, {weather} and all.
  turn it up, turn it up, they're playing our song.
  {instrument} and a full moon, and the night is ours.
  wait for me at {holyplace}, wait for me.
  {crop} in the fields and the {bird} in the air.
  and the years go by like {msg.transit:pl}.
  every {festival} I think of you.
  come back to {city}, come back.
  hey, hey, {fuel} on the fire.
)VG"
